      26:\\ Logarithm for (dx/y, x dx/y). For D = [P1 + P2 - Dinf] close to the origin, D ~ P2 - iota(P1) and
  [pball: tiny log, I1 = int g dz, I2 = int (x1 + z) g dz] ../lib/pball.gp:
      30:\\ h_0 = 1, and int_0^s g dz = sum h_n s/(n+1), int_0^s (x1 + z) g dz = sum h_n (x1 s/(n+1) + s^2/(n+2)).
